stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending: admitted, deadline timer started
    Pending --> Checking: first answer for this seq
    Pending --> Decided: deadline, link lost or halt
    Checking --> Decided: ACCEPT, REJECT or ERROR
    Decided --> Sent: immediate rule
    Decided --> Held: arrival or fixed rule
    Held --> Sent: earlier seqs sent, and for fixed its deadline reached
    Sent --> [*]
    note right of Held
        If a halt comes first,
        it is sent as unavailable
    end note
